Package: agrinutri
Title: N, P and K Fertilization Following Emilia-Romagna DPI 2026
Version: 1.0.0
URL: https://github.com/mcroci/agrinutri, https://mcroci.github.io/agrinutri/
BugReports: https://github.com/mcroci/agrinutri/issues
